      "content": "i know i should find help or whatever but it doesn't feel like it would change anything. the situation is just permanent. it feels like the only thing that actually makes sense is just... not being here. like, if i could just just go to sleep and not have to wake up to all this again. it feels like the only way to actually get some peace.",
